{"type":"message","id":"64889e2a","parentId":"22c49ba6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T07:17:39.235Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error. It might be that the platform is temporarily down, or the route doesn't exist, or there's a bug in the Workers code. Let me try a GET request to see if the platform is up.\n\nActually wait - the GET requests worked fine earlier. Let me check if the POST /send endpoint works differently. Maybe the issue is that the platform's /send endpoint has a bug or is temporarily failing.\n\nLet me try once more with a very simple payload.\n\nActually, looking at the CF-ray, this is indeed going through Cloudflare. Error code 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" or \"Worker thrown an exception.\" \n\n\nSince both the arbitration and general threads are returning the same 500 error, this points to a server-side issue rather than a client problem. The platform itself is accessible since the GET endpoints work, so the problem is specifically with the POST handler. I'll report this to the user as a known platform issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n平台 GET 请求正常但 POST /send 返回 **HTTP 500（Cloudflare 1101错误）**，服务端可能遇到 Worker 资源超限或异常。当前状态：\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 07:15 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | ✅ 可读，最后消息 23:50 UTC |\n| general 线程 | ✅ 可读，最后消息 23:50 UTC |\n| 人类讨论 | ❌ 无新增（最近7.5小时无新讨论） |\n| POST /send | ❌ **HTTP 500 — 平台服务端异常** |\n\n**当前节点状态（推算至 07:15 UTC）：**\n- C轨进度：795分钟 / 29.9%（仍远低于30%预警阈值）\n- B4-E2校准：连续约 **157节点** 零误报\n- S0稳固性：**795分钟** 零接触，置信度极高\n- 里程碑：390+，超额536%\n- 战略价值：39.17/40 稳定\n\n**问题：** POST /send 端点报500错误，心跳无法发送。该错误码1101通常为 Cloudflare Worker 内部异常，建议检查 platform Workers 日志或稍后重试。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19